{
  "info": {
    "name": "RouteWise - Payment Routing API",
    "description": "Every endpoint the backend exposes. Each request has a saved example response captured from a freshly seeded database.\n\nStart the backend on `http://localhost:8080`, then run **Login (biller)** or **Login (admin)** - the JWT is stored in `{{token}}` and sent with everything else.\n\n| Email | Password | Role |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `admin@fawry.com` | `Admin@123` | ADMIN |\n| `biller@fawry.com` | `User@123` | USER |\n| `water@fawry.com` | `User@123` | USER |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "billerId",
      "value": "2"
    },
    {
      "key": "gatewayId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
